{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33968","headline":"登初阳楼寄怀北平郎中 · 皮日休","name":"登初阳楼寄怀北平郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"危楼新制号初阳，白粉青葌射沼光。\n避酒几浮轻舴艋，下棊曾觉睡鸳鸯。\n投钩列坐围华烛，格簺分朋占靓妆。\n莫怪重登频有恨，二年曾侍旧吴王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33968.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33968","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}